# Public app domain

Bind `PublicAppDomain` in `Program.cs`. Missing value throws `ConfigurationError`. Do not expose it as GraphQL auth config.

```csharp
var domain = builder.Configuration["PublicAppDomain"]?.Trim().TrimEnd('/');
if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(domain))
    throw new ConfigurationError("В конфигурации обязателен ключ PublicAppDomain.");
```
